{"createdAt":"2026-10-21T12:41:00.512Z","data":{"_slug":"知らない","body":[{"_key":"htq331vo4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"h0drxn1zz","_type":"span","text":"知らないことがあるって、良いことでも悪いことでもあると思っている。"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"9sbjc5tey","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"1fq5xug1y","_type":"span","text":"何かを創る時、作り方を知ってしまっていると、それに囚われてしまう。"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"4jc9dnpfr","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"mos8gk20h","_type":"span","text":"でも、だからといって創り方を知ろうとしないと、みんなと同じものを作るのに時間がかかってしまう。創る動作をしていなくても作り方を知ることはできる。"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"zxysb8ocn","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"a5t6vwwvx","_type":"span","text":"だから自分は創り方を知っていても、それを常に疑い。続けなくてはいけない。本当にそれが最善なのか？"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"eyuxrssj5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"v2vgxw87z","_type":"span","text":"そのために、その知識を模倣し、深く知り、自分でそれをバラバラにして考えられないといけない。"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"mn3hd2z93","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"w0nbfhfsj","_type":"span","text":"何を言いたいのかわかんなくなったけど、創るのは楽しいね。"}],"style":"normal"}],"description":"","emoji":"🤷","published_updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:41:22.179Z","title":"知らない"},"id":"01M5F7NBB00E9Q1XKS48D1JMA6","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T12:41:18.802Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"知らない","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9F7FY1GFDY2YD68CSPVN","label":"雑記","locale":"ja","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"misc","translationGroup":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98"}]},"translationGroup":"01M5F7NBB00E9Q1XKS48D1JMA6"}
